    "body": "Can you expand on the reasoning? It seems we have a medium-strong precedent that `visibilitychange` is last, so I'd like more explanation before we start breaking that, including reasoning on what types of features should go before vs. after so that we can know in the future where to put things. What kind of code are developers writing, and what is the impact on that code with before vs. after? Why is this case different than screen orientation, device posture, or Web NFC?",
